
% Something Just Like This

a: IV | . V . . | vi | . V . . |
In: $a*2
fadeout: $a*2
Vr: $a*4
PCh: $a*4
Ch: $a*4
DCh: $a*4
a_sub: IV | . V . . | vi | . iii . . |
bridge: $a_sub*4
riser: $a_sub*4
b: IV | . V . . | vi | IV | . I . . | . V . I | V |
b_sub: iii | . V . . | vi | IV | . I . . | . V . I | V |
bridge_2: $b $b_sub
c: IV | . V . . | vi | I |
DCh_c: $c*4
S: [D] $In $Vr $PCh $Ch $DCh $Vr $PCh $Ch $bridge $riser $bridge_2 $DCh_c*2 $fadeout
